the police now, okay?


00:12:37.034 --> 00:12:38.275
You can't do that.
I will.


00:12:38.344 --> 00:12:39.344
I wouldn't.


00:12:40.034 --> 00:12:42.137
Don't tell anyone.


00:12:42.241 --> 00:12:44.275
I wouldn't tell
anyone at all.


00:12:44.379 --> 00:12:45.793
Don't you dare.


00:12:47.206 --> 00:12:48.724
Get up.


00:12:48.827 --> 00:12:50.413
